            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "The Max Plank Institute for Meteorology Earth System Model used here (MPI-ESM-LR; Giorgetta et al., 2012) is a low resolution model version that includes the ECHAM6 atmospheric GCM with T63 horizontal resolution (1.875\u00b0) and 47 vertical layers (Stevens et al., 2013; developed from ECHAM5 (Roeckner et al., 2006) with modifications in the shortwave radiative transfer and representation of the middle atmosphere). It is coupled to the MPIOM physical ocean model (Jungclaus et al., 2013; Marsland et al., 2003) which includes a thermodynamic-dynamic sea ice component (Notz et al., 2013) and ocean biogeochemistry model (HAMOCC5; Ilyina et al., 2013; Maier-Reimer, 1993; Maier-Reimer et al., 2005) implemented on a curvilinear bipolar orthogonal grid with a nominal horizontal resolution of 1.5\u00b0 and 40 z-levels which increase in thickness with depth.",
