            "paragraph": "The Hadley Centre Global Environment Model Version 2 Earth System Model (HadGEM2-ES, Collins et al., 2011; HadGEM2 Development Team, 2011) is also a coupled AOGCM and has an atmospheric resolution of N96 (1.875\u00b0 x 1.25\u00b0) with 38 vertical levels. The ocean model has a 1\u00b0 x 1\u00b0 horizontal resolution (increasing smoothly to 1/3\u00b0 at the equator) with 40 unevenly spaced depth levels. The ocean biogeochemistry component of this model is Diat-HadOCC, which is an NPZD model with two phytoplankton functional types (developed from the HadOCC model; Palmer and Totterdell, 2001), and includes the nutrient cycles of nitrogen, silica and iron along with prognostic tracers such as dissolved oxygen.",
